      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0",
      "artist": "shankar s. from Dubai, united arab emirates",
      "description": "An interesting Burmese representation of Buddhism is this symbol of the Guardian Protector. It apparently borrows the most important features from several earthly creatures and put them all together to protect humans from several evils. I found this interpretation pretty interesting. Notes are in a sign alongside thie statue, which appear in the next photograph/ caption. (Georgetown, Penang, Malaysia, Nov. 2013)",
